  "visible_text": " 508-238-1000 | HOURS AND LOCATIONS\nCUSTOMER LOGIN\n| \nPERSONAL\nChecking Accounts\nSaving Accounts\nStudent Checking\nMortgages\nPersonal Loans\nCDs & IRAs\nBUSINESS\nONLINE & MOBILE\nYour New Digital Banking\nRESOURCES\nWhy Choose Us?\nFederal Deposit Insurance\nOfficers and Directors\nPrivacy Policy\nOur Community\nNews and Info\nOther Services\nSwitch to Paperless\nATM/Debit Card Safety\nZelle\nRATES\nDeposit Rates\nPersonal Loan Rates\nHome Equity Rates\nMortgage Rates\nCONTACT US\nHappy Thanksgiving\n\nFrom all of us at Bank of Easton, we wish you and those you hold dear a warm, peaceful, and happy Thanksgiving.\n\nCONTACT US\nSame Bank. Better Banking Experience!\n\nYour new Digital Banking Experience is now live! Prior to logging in for the first time, please read the instructions on our information page.\n\nLEARN MORE\nFall CD Special\n\n12-Month 4.25%APY* Certificate of Deposit\n\nLEARN MORE\nBanking For Every Generation\n\nWe're committed to serving you today and paving the way for a secure financial future.\n\nFIND OUT MORE\nLocal Banking For Our Community\n\nLocal banks understand local needs, invest in the community, and provide personalized service, creating a stronger and more supportive local environment.\n\nFIND OUT MORE\nDrive Toward Your Dreams!\n\n5.50% APR Auto Loans for new and used vehicles,\n\nSEE DETAILS\nFinancial Support For Your Business\n\nWe're dedicated to the well-being of our local businesses, ensuring their security, and fostering prosperity throughout the community.\n\nFIND OUT MORE\nOpen an Account Online\n\nOpening an account or switching from your existing bank to the Bank of Easton is easy. Just click below and make an appointment with one of our advisors today. We’re ready to help!\n\nOpen an Account\n\nPersonal Accounts\n\nOur personal accounts are as diverse as our community. We have accounts that provide a comfortable fit for any lifestyle. Find the account that fits yours today!\n\nView Personal Accounts\n\nBusiness Accounts\n\nYour business is unique and tailored to meet the needs of your customers, your priority is customer satisfaction–so is ours! Check out what we have to offer your business.\n\nView Business Accounts\n\nWhy Choose Bank of Easton\n\nChoosing the Bank of Easton over a larger bank can provide many benefits, including the opportunity to support Easton’s people and small businesses. To learn more about the benefits of banking with the Bank of Easton.\n\nCLICK HERE\nLocally Owned & Operated\n\nLocal ownership means community investment, personalized service, and a bank that truly understands and supports your financial needs.\n\nCustomer-Centric Service\n\nOur belief in putting the customer first ensures your needs are our top priority, making banking a breeze and your satisfaction our mission.\n\nInvesting in Our Community\n\nGiving back to the community creates a stronger, more prosperous neighborhood where we all thrive and benefit together.\n\nSupporting Our Neighborhood\n\nNurturing our neighborhood ensures a brighter future for everyone who calls Easton home.\n\nOPEN AN ACCOUNT\nCustomer Stories\n\nOur mission is to stay connected with our community and to provide you, our customers with news and information that is important and timely.\n\nBrad Minuskin\nKim Heise\nTim DiBona\nTim Fisher\nNeighborly Banking Since 1889\n\nWe believe that responsible banking includes being a good neighbor. That’s why we call what we do “neighborly banking,” we put our community first.\n\nOur Approach\nFamily Trust\nSince 1889\nNeighborly Banking\n\nAt Bank of Easton, we pride ourselves on neighborly banking, where personalized service and community connections make us your trusted financial partner.\n\nPutting Community First\n\nPutting community first means investing in local businesses, supporting local initiatives, and ensuring our neighborhood thrives together.\n\nStaying Local\n\nStaying local allows us to understand your unique needs, providing tailored solutions and contributing to the growth and well-being of our community.\n\nBranches and ATMs\n\nGet cash at any ATM that displays the NYCE, Accel, Cirrus, or Maestro logo. Or visit one of our locations.\n\nOur Locations\n\nNeed Help ?\n\nWe’re always available to help. Explore ways to contact us depending on your needs.\n\nGet in Touch\n\nNews and Community Events\n\nKeeping customers informed is vital, ensuring they make informed decisions, stay secure, and stay connected to the community they trust.\n\nDivas with a Twist Holiday Concert–December 4, 2026\n\nOctober 7, 2026\n\nEaston Celebrates America 250\n\nSeptember 13, 2026\n\nHardening Your Home for Winter: A Smart Guide to Using Your Equity\n\nAugust 5, 2026\n\nStay in control of your money 24/7 with the Bank of Easton mobile app. Check balances, send money, and control your debit cards at the touch of a button.\n\n  \n\nWe are Here to Help You\nGENERAL INQUIRIES\n\nQuestions about opening an account or switching to Bank of Easton please email us and an advisor will be in touch.\n\nEmail Us\nCALL ONE OF OUR OFFICES\n\nWashington Street: 508-238-1000\nRobert Drive: 508-238-2092\n\nTALK TO AN ADVISOR\n\nFor questions about mortgages or home equity loans, contact Margaret Murray\n\nEmail Margaret Murray\n\n\n\n\nFACEBOOK\nINSTAGRAM\nQuick Calls\nHome\nPersonal Banking\nBusiness Banking\nCurrent Rates\nContact Us\nService Fees\n\nMain Office:\n508-238-1000\n\nRobert Drive Office:\n508-238-2092\n\nREPORT A LOST OR\nSTOLEN DEBIT CARD BY\nCALLING 800-472-3272\n\n© 2026 Bank of Easton. All Rights Reserved\n\nPrivacy Policy  | CRA Public File",
